              <td><strong>Game of Thrones</strong></td>
              <td>Ait Benhaddou &amp; Essaouira</td>
              <td>Daenerys Targaryen liberating the slave city of Yunkai &amp; Astapor</td>
              <td>Climb to the clifftop granary overlooking the entire valley</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Lawrence of Arabia (1962)</strong></td>
              <td>Ait Benhaddou &amp; Ouarzazate</td>
              <td>David Lean’s classic desert sequences and desert fortress scenes</td>
              <td>The historical genesis of cinema tourism in Morocco</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>The Mummy (1999)</strong></td>
              <td>Erg Chebbi &amp; Erfoud</td>
              <td>The ancient lost city of Hamunaptra</td>
              <td>Explore via 4x4 on our <a href="/tour-premium-explorer.html">Sahara Luxury Explorer</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Kingdom of Heaven (2005)</strong></td>
              <td>Atlas Film Studios</td>
